Settings persistence: loads user_settings.cfg at startup (where NZ:P's menus save to) and saves changed settings when the app is paused, closed or the game quits.

Apply from the root of the idTech4A++ checkout (tag v1.1.0harmattan73):
    git apply --check --whitespace=nowarn nzp-fteqw-settings.patch && git apply --whitespace=nowarn nzp-fteqw-settings.patch

